# Turn Inside Out may target any creature. Bot2's Llanowar Elves get +3/+0 and Bot1 bolts them: "when it dies this
# turn, manifest dread" is Bot1's delayed ability (CR 603.7d: controlled by the spell's controller), so Bot1 - not the
# Elves' owner - looks at its own library's top two, and Bot2's library is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Turn Inside Out
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

